DreamTweenBPLibrary:LocalPositionXTo_Sweep {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenBPLibrary.h#DreamTweenBPLibrary:LocalPositionXTo_Sweep
    src   "The _Sweep nodes carry no hit-result pin. They used to take one as an out-parameter, and it was\nnever written: a sweep happens on every tick for as long as the tween runs, while the node's\nstack frame -- and with it that parameter -- is gone the moment the node returns. The tween now\nowns the FHitResult it sweeps into (see UDreamTweenerPosition::sweepHitResult); a pin that could\nonly ever hand back a default-constructed result was worse than no pin at all."
    text  "_Sweep 节点没有命中结果引脚。它们过去将其作为输出参数接收，但该参数\n从未被写入：只要补间还在运行，每次 tick 都会发生一次扫描，而节点的\n栈帧——连同该参数——在节点返回的瞬间就不存在了。现在补间\n自己持有它扫描写入的 FHitResult（见 UDreamTweenerPosition::sweepHitResult）；一个\n只能返回默认构造结果的引脚，还不如没有引脚。"
    state machine
}

